  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c1a2f9ab33e780cba5010b6de702b28619de1d1b1c922808fce2123379d05d37.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) × and –**\n\n→ 39 × **3 ÷ 13** + 16 – 8 = 17\n\n→ **39 ****× 3/13** + 16 – 8 = 17\n\n→ **9 + 16** – 8 = 17\n\n→ 25 – 8 = 17\n\n→ 17 = 17 → **LHS = RHS**.\n\n**2) + and –**\n\n→ 39 + **3 ÷ 13** – 16 × 8 = 17\n\n→ 39 + 3/13 – **16 × 8** = 17\n\n→ **39 + 3/13** – 128 = 17\n\n→ 510/13 – 128 ≠ 17 →** LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\n**3)** **÷ and –**\n\n→ **39 ÷ 3** – 13 + 16 × 8 = 17\n\n→ 13 – 13 + **16 × 8** = 17\n\n→ 13 – 13 + 128 = 17\n\n→ 128 ≠ 17 → **LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\n**4) × and ÷**\n\n→ 39 – 3 × 13 + **16 ÷ 8** = 17\n\n→ 39 – **3 ****×**** 13** + 2 = 17\n\n→ 39 – 39 + 2 = 17 \n\n→ 2 ≠ 17 →** LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 gives the correct equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"× and –\"**.",
